{"id": "DfU8S4iSisL", "title": "Video by devanshu.motion", "description": "Maa Parvati ne Shani Dev ko khud hi aagya di, aur khud hi shraap de diya. Kyun?\n\nGanesh ji ka sar Golok ja chuka tha, isliye Bhagwan Vishnu Pushpabhadra nadi ke kinare se ek gajraj ka sar laaye. Phir Maa ne bhari sabha mein Shani Dev ko shraap diya, aur Brahma ji ke samjhane par unhe grahon ka raja bhi bana diya.\n\nAb ek sawaal: gajraj ko toh doosre hathi ka sar mil gaya, phir Ganesh ji ko insaan ka sar kyun nahi mila? Yahi sawaal Narad ji ne bhi poochha tha. Jawab pinned comment mein hai.\n\nPart 3 of 3.\n\nAapko yeh jawab pehle pata tha? 👇\n\n#shanidev #shani #ganesh #hindumythology #sanatandharma", "channel": "devanshu.motion", "uploader_id": "25176808901", "uploader": "Devanshu Singhai", "timestamp": 1793811833, "like_count": 10291, "comment_count": 56, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/146.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-2180668459491417a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 58.083, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQN6VhTfXsu-iG1Ygs2eJLXYOpEMirwFpYBRRJrSGvf6cAJHAkL4c0LCnEvGOAPiw2MAUHi69gzM57DtEQ4jRMwZuaAzEOR4MgG64fc.mp4?_nc_cat=104&_nc_oc=AdrA51FEcNRNOD9l8ZwjFN6nHt2NFbEEAakDh00JJTItkfJI0gaP519-RULFzd1zbyD0jgfF3lPe1QsIC7UI2Hkq&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=qjtbIYi7w48Q7kNvwE6bUG_&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=-FzkQ6735an44h3KxyiWIw&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQTaJdNI0YlLcDH7NoljtvAGURLdQhDDJNV1cdzIQVGuzg&oe=6AF45AD5", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ex